$$\n\nSo, **18 seats** are occupied by administrators.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find the number of remaining seats\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining seats} = 72 - 18 = 54\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Find the number of seats occupied by parents\n\n$$\n\\text{Parent seats} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18\n$$\n\nSo, **18 seats** are occupied by parents.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Find the number of seats occupied by students\n\n$$\n\\text{Student seats} = \\text{Remaining seats} - \\text{Parent seats} = 54 - 18 = 36\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nSo, **36 students** were in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 9.914938769303262, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "3862141deb409f7768b8440905e1b7a4e3c88c7e0de5c5b2258a32d06db8f37f", "output_tokens": 378, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20525605888, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20820525056, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1cd8fbe40f4cda30", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 9949.646377936006}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "36", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 9.949646377936006, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20820525056, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20820525056, "sampling_seed": 8950312953517198488, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 378, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03316926956176758, "turn_index": 0}
